/-! ## §4 — Gate-1 arithmetic at `c = 37/4` -/

/-- **Gate-1 arithmetic at `c = 37/4` under the hybrid scheme.**

States the COMPUTED gate value `0.93508596`, not the fixed `3/4` of the
old `Mc_lb = 1/8` shape. That fixed target is false from `c = 29/4` on (here the
margin against it is `-0.18508596`), while the parameterised criterion
`L0(c−r)·r < Mc_lb` holds far beyond it — so the bound must be the real one. -/
theorem gate1_arithmetic_hybrid {epsOm : ℝ} (hEps : epsOm ≤ 1 / 10 ^ 21) :
    (1369/16 : ℝ) * ((172827001/16000000000 : ℝ) + 7 / 10 ^ 7 + 12 / 10 ^ 8 + epsOm)
      + (37/4 : ℝ) * ((373234953/320000000000 : ℝ) + 7 / 10 ^ 7 + 12 / 10 ^ 8 + epsOm)
      ≤ 14961375378825000001517/16000000000000000000000 := by
  nlinarith [hEps]

end

